instructions:
In package.json, at the text `{
  "name": "demo",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test"
  }
}`: Keep name, type and the existing test script exactly as they are, and add a single new top-level key after "type":
  "bin": {
    "todo": "bin/todo.js"
  },
so the final file is:
{
  "name": "demo",
  "type": "module",
  "bin": {
    "todo": "bin/todo.js"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test"
  }
}
Do not add dependencies, do not rename the package, do not change the test script.
